{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/issues/34292","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/issues/34292/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/issues/34292/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/issues/34292/events","html_url":"https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/issues/34292","id":4898550480,"node_id":"I_kwDOC4Q8Qs8AAAABI_ny0A","number":34292,"title":"Source control push does not detect \"Available in MCP\" workflow setting change","user":{"login":"Marshall-Qiu","id":89381510,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzgxNTEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89381510?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu","html_url":"https://github.com/Marshall-Qiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marshall-Qiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9542225587,"node_id":"LA_kwDOC4Q8Qs8AAAACOMLOsw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/labels/status:in-linear","name":"status:in-linear","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Issue or PR is now in Linear"},{"id":9542227923,"node_id":"LA_kwDOC4Q8Qs8AAAACOMLX0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/labels/status:team-assigned","name":"status:team-assigned","color":"d93f0b","default":false,"description":"A team has been assigned the issue or PR"},{"id":10081993897,"node_id":"LA_kwDOC4Q8Qs8AAAACWO8EqQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/labels/team:lifecycle","name":"team:lifecycle","color":"7A36AC","default":false,"description":"Issue is with the Lifecycle & Governance team"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-16T04:00:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T15:42:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Bug Description\n\nWhen a workflow's **\"Available in MCP\"** setting is the *only* thing changed, the source-control push modal does not list the workflow as modified, so the change cannot be pushed to the protected/remote instance.\n\nAs a workaround I currently have to make an additional (unwanted) edit to a node/connection just so the workflow shows up as pushable — which also pushes that unwanted change.\n\n**Root cause (from source):** Source control determines whether a workflow changed by comparing only `versionId`, `parentFolderId`, and `owner` (`isWorkflowModified` in `packages/cli/src/modules/source-control.ee/source-control-helper.ee.ts:459`). The \"Available in MCP\" toggle is stored inside the workflow `settings` object (`availableInMCP` — `packages/workflow/src/interfaces.ts:3620`) and a settings-only change does **not** generate a new `versionId` (`packages/cli/src/services/workflow.service.ts:412`, and the bulk toggle path `packages/cli/src/modules/mcp/mcp.settings.service.ts:207`). The exported workflow file *does* include the full `settings` object (`source-control-export.service.ee.ts:137`), but the status comparison never diffs file content — so the change is invisible to the push modal.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. On an instance connected to source control (environments), with a workflow already committed/pushed.\n2. Open the workflow and toggle **Available in MCP** (in Workflow Settings, or via the MCP settings/card toggle) — change nothing else.\n3. Open the source control **Push** modal.\n4. The workflow is **not** listed as changed, so the setting change cannot be pushed.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nA change to \"Available in MCP\" (and, more generally, any workflow `settings` change) should mark the workflow as modified so it appears in the push modal and can be pushed on its own.\n\n### n8n Version\n\n2.26.3\n\n### Database\n\nN/A — logic bug, reproducible on any DB\n\n### Execution Mode\n\nN/A\n\n### Hosting\n\nSelf-hosted (source control / environments is an Enterprise feature)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/issues/34292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n8n-io/n8n/issues/34292/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}